<p class="lt-chem-365739">The determination of iron in an industrial waste stream is carried out by the <em>o</em>-phenanthroline described in <a title="10.3: UV/Vis and IR Spectroscopy" href="https://chem.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Analytical_Chemistry/Analytical_Chemistry_2.1_(Harvey)/10%3A_Spectroscopic_Methods/10.03%3A_UV_Vis_and_IR_Spectroscopy#method10.3.1" rel="internal">Representative Method 10.3.1</a>. Using the data in the following table, determine the mg Fe/L in the waste stream.</p>

